  "description": "This CAT 0 & CAT 1 Scarifier with Adjustable Tines is a perfect CAT-0 & Cat 1 attachment accessory for initial soil preparation. Beveled edge, spring steel tines cut through hard pack soil, breaking up tough soil and preparing the hard-packed ground for landscaping. Attaches to a CAT 0 & Cat 1 System with the included pins.\nFitment\nFits both CAT-0 and CAT-1 tractors;\nFeatures\nSoil Preparation Capability‌:The Cultivator brings loose, raised soil to your garden or land, making it suitable for initial soil preparation and providing a solid foundation for seed work.\nAdjustable Steel Shanks‌:This Scarifier features 6 removable and height-adjustable steel shanks, allowing it to perfectly adapt to various tillage conditions.\nMaterial Construction‌:Made from heavy-duty carbon steel, each shank comes with a strong, durable steel tine that ensures tillage depth.\nCompatibility with Tractors‌:The Cultivator fits CAT-1&CAT-0 tractors and includes mounting brackets for easy installation on most tractors without additional modifications.\nDimensions and Weight‌:With an overall length of 48 inches, width of 38 inches, height of 7.5 inches, and a weight of 101.4 lbs. , this Cultivator is designed for efficient and effective gardening tasks.",
